<title>PHILIPPINES: Republic Q3 net at 27.101 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Republic Q3 net at 27.101 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Cement Corp said on Tuesday it posted a third quarter net income of 27.101 million pesos this year.</p>
<p>Net sales totalled 364.369 million pesos for the period, while cost of sales amounted to 297.982 million pesos.</p>
<p>Operating expenses reached 28.893 million pesos.</p>
<p>Comparative figures were not immediately available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
